# C-dev trial import + remote inventory verification — 2026-10-19

Owner approved read-only Turso access for this session (goal decision,
2026-10-19). All Turso operations below were reads (`turso db list`,
`turso db show`, `turso db shell` SELECTs, `turso db export`). Nothing
was written to Turso; no production cutover; no subscription changes.
Row *contents* were compared for one small table only and are not
recorded here; the export file lived in a local scratch dir and was
deleted after verification.

## Remote facts (turso CLI, account dracondev, 2026-10-19)

Sizes are `turso db show` values at read time; counts are
